{{ evidence_integrity | length }} evidence files were cryptographically
validated via SHA-256 hashes computed at ingestion and verified against the
case database.
{% endif %}
{{ total_tool_calls }} tool calls were executed across {{ sources | length }}
indexed sources over the course of the investigation, with full provenance
tracking via append-only JSONL audit log.

